{title: Laagi Lagan Shankara}
{artist: Hansraj Raghuwanshi}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D]Bhole Baba Teri Kya hi,        [Cadd9]Baat Hai
[D]Bhole Shankara Teri Kya hi,        [Cadd9]Baat Hai
[D]Door Hoke Bhi Tu Saath Hai Hooo,        [Am]Door Hoke Bhi Tu [D]Saath Hai
[D]Khud Ko Mai Kar Dunga Tujhko Samarpan,        [G]Main Tera Ansu Hu Tu Mera Darpan
[C]Tere He Hone Se Meri Ye Saari,        [Am]Zindagi [D]Sajji Hai
[D]Laagi Meri Tere Sang,        [C]Laggi O Mere Shankara
[Am]Laagi Meri Tere Sang,        [D]Laggi O Mere Shankara
[D]Laagi Meri Preet Tere,        [C]Sang Mere Shankara
[Am]Laagi Meri Preet Tere,        [D]Sang Mere Shankara
[D]Tu Pita Hai Mera,        [G]Aur Tu He Rahega
[C]Meri Har Galti Ko Tu,        [Am]Haskar [D]Sahega
[D]Tere Jaapse Manka,        [G]Ud Gaya Hai Re Panchi
[C]Sab Teri Badaulat Hai,        [Am]Aaj Raghu [D]wanshi
[D]Tu Suksham Hai Or Tu He Vishal Hai,        [G]Tu Uttar Hai Or Tu He Sawaal Hai
[C]Tu Hi Satya Baaki,        Zinda [Am]gi Bhi Na [D]Sagi Hai
[D]Laagi Meri Tere Sang,        [C]Laggi O Mere Shankara
[Am]Laagi Meri Tere Sang,        [D]Laggi O Mere Shankara
[D]Laagi Meri Preet Tere,        [C]Sang Mere Shankara
[Am]Laagi Meri Preet Tere,        [D]Sang Mere Shankara
[D]Dhyaan Mein Ha Magan,        Tann [Cadd9]Pe Odh Kar K Re Choli
Mujhe [Am]Apne Rang Mein Rang De,        Sangg [D]Khel Mere Holi
[D]Naa Aasan Hai Niche Na Hai,        [Cadd9]Koi Khatoli
Mujhe [Am]Apne Rang Mein Rang De,        Sang [D]Khel Mere Holi
[D]Bus Bhi Karo Ab Mere Shankara,        [G]Bhaag Ragad K Boli Ye Gora
[C]Tum Nahi Raje Ho Gora,        [G]Loat K [D]Raji Hai
